{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bloody Dash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strike, movement, and reward in one action.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, instant body strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pierces <strong>through</strong> enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Dynamics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free and dynamic movement.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach maximum speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move as fast as a lightning bolt and remain unharmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a freight train.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutalist Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our world, you are not a hero but just a cog in the system that has gotten out of control of the totalitarian machine and is now taking his revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a setting of brutal and towering buildings, endless factories, and monumental palaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fall for the propaganda appeals and their hypnotizing slogans, destroy the system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is in the early stages of active development. Currently, we're focused on the game's foundation and refining its core mechanics. However, we regularly share updates on our progress. Follow us on social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Add BLEEDING to your wishlist to stay up to date with the first gameplay demos, support the studio, and be the first to hear development news!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1765123396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844800?t=1765123396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765123396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/6daa2033b87afd62d27f4d651a699c732b48e482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765123396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bloody Dash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strike, movement, and reward in one action.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, instant body strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pierces <strong>through</strong> enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/7675085635c15a1842eec5be9388ec34.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Dynamics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free and dynamic movement.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach maximum speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move as fast as a lightning bolt and remain unharmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a freight train.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1280 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/976b31f8ec75aa04e6b683c6f83717e7.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutalist Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our world, you are not a hero but just a cog in the system that has gotten out of control of the totalitarian machine and is now taking his revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a setting of brutal and towering buildings, endless factories, and monumental palaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fall for the propaganda appeals and their hypnotizing slogans, destroy the system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.poster.avif?t=1765123396\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.webm?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/extras/2c0f08db4fd57db2e2a4e7554db553ec.mp4?t=1765123396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is in the early stages of active development. Currently, we're focused on the game's foundation and refining its core mechanics. However, we regularly share updates on our progress. Follow us on social media!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Add BLEEDING to your wishlist to stay up to date with the first gameplay demos, support the studio, and be the first to hear development news!</strong></p>","developers":["Depra"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844800/a4875824fcadefe25c3f39a6da38064f642878b1/header.jpg?t=1765123396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/1147054101/abc6969b8dfd568e8e78c9d8b2654942bd0e8200/1757352721/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757369538","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/1147054101/abc6969b8dfd568e8e78c9d8b2654942bd0e8200/1757352721/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757369538","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/1147054101/abc6969b8dfd568e8e78c9d8b2654942bd0e8200/1757352721/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757369538","id":257194649,"name":"BLEEDING Announcement Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194649/d7653751d7b43334f36155adf06fe47e53462a32/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757369538"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/163646537/3a3d49199bb62bbab1e1d0186f905c1158473b3c/1764523207/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764524762","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/163646537/3a3d49199bb62bbab1e1d0186f905c1158473b3c/1764523207/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764524762","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3844800/163646537/3a3d49199bb62bbab1e1d0186f905c1158473b3c/1764523207/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764524762","id":257240883,"name":"Dash. Smash. Kill. Repeat.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257240883/452038d9ee56f0ee983f2a8976d86bf55ce34ebe/movie_600x337.jpg?